# Headset session 16, launch 2: each set's render starts 4 ms after the wake-up instead of at once
# (KARTFRAME_AHEAD_START_US; sets are still two refreshes ahead, ends still at the wake-up). Session 14's
# drained launch shifted our GPU work by ~4 ms and cleared the left eye; this moves the work's phase inside
# the refresh without the drain's lateness. Routine as always.
KARTFRAME_AHEAD_START_US=4000
KARTFRAME_FRAME_LOG=1
KARTFRAME_RECORD=raw
KARTFRAME_SESSION_ENV_ONCE=1
